{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24765","headline":"和柳公权登齐云楼 · 白居易","name":"和柳公权登齐云楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楼外春晴百鸟鸣，楼中春酒美人倾。\n路傍花日添衣色，云里天风散佩声。\n向此高吟谁得意，偶来闲客独多情。\n佳时莫起兴亡恨，游乐今逢四海清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24765.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24765","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}